  "shortName": null,
  "description": "BerliCon was a small furry convention held annually in Berlin, Germany, from 2004 to 2015. It was organized by Riffuchs, Phelan, Hoyt and MafunDi, with MafunDi leading it after 2013 and AmurUssuri after 2014. The first three editions were one-day events at a church community hall, and from 2007 it became a multi-day camping-style convention at sites around Berlin, with attendance growing from 23 to 89. The twelfth edition in 2015 was the last.",
